 # 🚀 Jira to GitHub Automation Project

## 📌 Overview

This project automates the process of converting a Jira ticket into a GitHub workflow. It performs the following actions automatically:

* Fetches a Jira ticket
* Creates a Git branch based on the ticket
* Commits changes
* Pushes the branch to GitHub
* Creates a Pull Request (PR)

---

## 🎯 Objective

The goal of this project is to simulate a real-world DevOps workflow where:

👉 Developers pick a Jira ticket
👉 Work on code
👉 Create a branch
👉 Push changes
👉 Raise a PR for review

This script automates all these steps.

---

